group.long  0x0++0x3
    line.long 0x00 "DUALTIMER2_ADDRESSBLOCK0_TIMER1LOAD, Contains the value from which the Timer 1 counter is to decrement. This is the value used to reload the counter when Periodic mode is enabled, and the current count reaches 0. When this register is written to directly, the current count is immediately reset to the new value. RESET:0x0"
