    line.long 0x00 "DUALTIMER2_ADDRESSBLOCK0_TIMER1BGLOAD, This register contains the value from which Timer 1 counter is to decrement. This is the value used to reload the Timer 1 counter when Periodic mode is enabled, and the current count reaches 0. This register provides an alternative method of accessing Timer 1 Load value register. The difference is that writes to this register do not cause Timer 1 counter to immediately restart from the new value. Reading from this register returns the same value returned from Timer 1 Load value. RESET:0x0"
