    line.long 0x00 "DMA350_APB4SLVADDRESSBLOCK_IIDR, Implementation Identification Register  This register provides information about the implementer of the DMAC. RESET:0x3a00043b"
         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--11. 1. " DMA350_APB4SLVADDRESSBLOCK_IIDR_IMPLEMENTER ,Contains the JEP106 code of the company that implemented the IP:  - [11:8]: JEP106 continuation code of implementer.  - [7]: Always 0.  - [6:0]: JEP106 identity code of implementer. For Arm this field reads as 0x43B. RESET:0x43b"
          
