         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--31. 1. " DMA350_APB4SLVADDRESSBLOCK_DMACH1_CH_SRCADDRHI_SRCADDRHI ,Source Address [63:32]. Allows 64-bit addressing but the system might need less address bits defined by ADDR_WIDTH. The not implemented bits remain reserved. RESET:0x0"
          
