         bitfld.long 0x00 0.--1. " EMMC_REG_BLOCK_ADMA_ERR_STAT_R_ADMA_ERR_STATES ,ADMA Error States  These bits indicate the state of ADMA when an error occurs during ADMA data transfer. RESET:0x0" "ST_FDS-1,ST_STOP-0,ST_TFR-3,UNUSED-2"
          
