    line.long 0x00 "EMMC_REG_BLOCK_ADMA_SA_LOW_R, This register holds the lower 32-bit system address for DMA transfer. This register is applicable for an SD/eMMC/UHS-II mode. RESET:0x0"
         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--31. 1. " EMMC_REG_BLOCK_ADMA_SA_LOW_R_ADMA_SA_LOW ,ADMA System Address  These bits indicate the lower 32 bits of the ADMA system address.  - SDMA: If Host Version 4 Enable is set to 1, this register stores the system address of the data location  - ADMA2: This register stores the byte address of the executing command of the descriptor table  - ADMA3: This register is set by ADMA3. ADMA2 increments the address of this register that points to the next line, every time a Descriptor line is fetched. RESET:0x0"
          
