    line.long 0x00 "GPIO_INTEN, Interrupt enable status RESET:0x0"
         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--31. 1. " GPIO_INTEN_INTEN ,0 : Interrupt disabled 1: Interrupt enabled. Interrupt enable register is used to mask the interrupt line (module output gpioint_oi). It does not mask the intstatus register RESET:0x0"
          
