    line.long 0x00 "PMU_RI_PMU_CTRL_ULP_CFG, Customize the ULP VDDVAR voltage for different PMU modes (votlahe = 400mV + 25mV * register field value). WARNING - RISKS FROM USING NON CUSTOM VALUES! RESET:0x40c0"
