         bitfld.long 0x00 11. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_DBYTE0_P0_DXLCDLSTATUS_DXLCDLSTICKYLOCK ,Latched value of whether the LCDL ever achieved lock after the assertion of LcdlTstEnable. RESET:0x0"
          
