    line.long 0x00 "LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_DBYTE1_P0_DXLCDLSTATUS, Status of dbyte macro LCDL selected by Register LcdlStatusSel  Note, this register is per dbyte. RESET:0x0"
         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--9. 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_DBYTE1_P0_DXLCDLSTATUS_DXLCDLFINESNAPVAL ,Value of the LCDL 1UI estimate code, latched by pulse on csr LcdlFineSnap while csr LcdlTstEnable=1. Index 9 is reserved for growth. RESET:0x0"
          
