         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--15. 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_DB8LCDLCALPHDETOUT_DB8LCDLCALPHDETOUT ,Reserved for PHY training firmware use. RESET:0x0"
          
