         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--15. 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_PLLTESTMODE_P0_PLLTESTMODE_P0 ,It is required to use default values for this CSR unless directed otherwise by Synopsys. Directly connected to testmode[15:0] pin of PLL RESET:0x124"
          
