         bitfld.long 0x00 0. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_PLLSTANDBYEFF_PLLSTANDBYEFF ,Returns state off PLL standby. PLL will be in standby in PHY LP2 states. RESET:0x0"
          
