    line.long 0x00 "LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_PLLDACVALOUT, PLL's Dacval_out output RESET:0x0"
         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--4. 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_PLLDACVALOUT_PLLDACVALOUT ,Directly connected to the pll's dacval_out output. Used for observation of PLL DAC code. RESET:0x0"
          
