    line.long 0x00 "LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_MAPCAB6TODFI, Maps PHY CAB lane 6 from dfi1_address of the index of the register contents RESET:0x6"
         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--3. 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_MAPCAB6TODFI_MAPCAB6TODFI ,For LPDDR3 and LPDDR4 applications, these CSRs map a dfi1_address to CAB 6.  - Unused for DDR3 and unused for DDR4 applications.  - Unused for the 3-ANIB configuration. Each register in the set of MapCABtoDfi must have a unique value within the set.  For example, if PHY CAB6 is mapped from dfi1_address[2], then Register MapCAB6toDfi should be 2.  - LPDDR4 ACX3 registers MapCAB[0..9]toDfi are reserved, second channel not supported.  - LPDDR4 ACX6,ACX10,ACX12 registers MapCAB[0..5]toDfi are used, values 0-5 are valid,  - values 6-15 are reserved  - registers MapCAB[6..9]toDfi are reserved  - LPDDR3 ACX3 not supported.  - LPDDR3 ACX6 registers MapCAB[0..9] are unused, second channel not supported.  - LPDDR3 ACX10,ACX12 registers MapCAB[0..9]toDfi are used, values 0-9 are valid,  - values 10-15 are reserved RESET:0x6"
          
group.long  0x22e++0x3
    line.long 0x00 "LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_MAPCAB7TODFI, Maps PHY CAB lane 7 from dfi1_address of the index of the register contents RESET:0x7"
         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--3. 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_MAPCAB7TODFI_MAPCAB7TODFI ,For LPDDR3 and LPDDR4 applications, these CSRs map a dfi1_address to CAB 7.  - Unused for DDR3 and unused for DDR4 applications.  - Unused for the 3-ANIB configuration. Each register in the set of MapCABtoDfi must have a unique value within the set.  For example, if PHY CAB7 is mapped from dfi1_address[2], then Register MapCAB7toDfi should be 2.  - LPDDR4 ACX3 registers MapCAB[0..9]toDfi are reserved, second channel not supported.  - LPDDR4 ACX6,ACX10,ACX12 registers MapCAB[0..5]toDfi are used, values 0-5 are valid,  - values 6-15 are reserved  - registers MapCAB[6..9]toDfi are reserved  - LPDDR3 ACX3 not supported.  - LPDDR3 ACX6 registers MapCAB[0..9] are unused, second channel not supported.  - LPDDR3 ACX10,ACX12 registers MapCAB[0..9]toDfi are used, values 0-9 are valid,  - values 10-15 are reserved RESET:0x7"
          
