         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--3. 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_DFIHANDSHAKEDELAYS1_PHYUPDACKDELAY1 ,Adds 0-15 DfiClks of delay after dfi1_phyupd_ack asserts, before the PHY takes any action (such as starting DDL calibration). RESET:0x0"
          
