rgroup.long 0x27c++0x3
    line.long 0x00 "LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_REMOTEIMPCAL, This CSR is written by HW to provide information about remote impedance calibration status. The CSR value allows SW to determine if the PHY is acting as calibration slave (1) or master (0). If PHY is acting as calibration slave then this CSR can be checked to determine if calibration codes have been captured. RESET:0x0"
         bitfld.long 0x00 0. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_REMOTEIMPCAL_CALIBSLAVE ,- if DWC_DDRPHY_REMOTE_IMP_CAL is defined, HW sets this field when the PHY is acting as calibration slave. - if DWC_DDRPHY_REMOTE_IMP_CAL is not defined, this field is reserved. RESET:0x0"
          
         bitfld.long 0x00 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_MASTER0_P0_REMOTEIMPCAL_SLAVECODEUPDATED ,- if DWC_DDRPHY_REMOTE_IMP_CAL is defined, HW sets this field when PHY is acting as calibration slave and calibration codes from the master have been loaded. - if DWC_DDRPHY_REMOTE_IMP_CAL is not defined, this field is reserved. RESET:0x0"
          
