    line.long 0x00 "LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_DRTUB0_CURPSTATE0B, PIE current Pstate value RESET:0x0"
         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--3. 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_DRTUB0_CURPSTATE0B_CURPSTATE0B ,PIE current Pstate value. This register is used to select values for writing by the Pstate sequencer and is written in the beginning of the Pstate switch. It can also be used to reference which Pstate the sequencer thinks it's in. RESET:0x0"
          
