         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--5. 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_DBYTE0_P1_RXCLKCDLYTG3_U0_P1_RXCLKCDLYTG3_U0_P1 ,Trained Read DQS_c to RxClkc Delay (Timing Group DEST=3). Trained to generate read DQ receive clock from the received read DQS_c.  - RxClkc Delay (6 bits, fine delay only); (For Timing Group 3)  - RxClkcDlyTg3[4:0] is the fine delay, ie one unit of delay is one-thirtysecond of a UI = UI/32.  - RxClkcDlyTg3[5] is reserved. There is no coarse delay field, ie the max configurable delay is 31/32 UI.  - Register Block Offset Address 0x093 controls the lower DQ nibble RxClkc timing. (For Timing Group 3)  - Register Block Offset Address 0x193 controls the upper DQ nibble RxClkc timing. (For Timing Group 3) Note: These Registers are replicated per pstate.  Note: Timing Group 3 = RANK3. RESET:0x10"
          
