         hexmask.long 0x00 0.--15. 1. " LPDDR4_PUB_DWC_DDRPHYA_INITENG0_P1_SEQ0BGPR6_P1_SEQ0BGPR6_P1 ,Reserved for PHY Initialization Engine (PIE) image use. RESET:0x0"
          
